4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s3XcAF_7qd4Q7kNvwHpuPcs&_nc_oc=AdoLdf8OQjPOHpGvG-O9Lmr0ZdyGusHgu1F7i2WSSDpQ7jDZRKclVaU6e_jk1NyW_2o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_HXKl9u5tgwkkgM9dDDRMpWFdiAazb7B10cN2sYYxx3w&oe=6A280F54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JDMO1-4OmhkQ7kNvwFQFrKH&_nc_oc=Adp0UlpIBN6TCyqF4-VuvTULKNbJ3R_4JuldAKb0LUqdzCkBOhzPHzf_cKUIvesGp2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ROCY0MyCO7JPJHyJMQ1m9qlZLgAJUtLIiN2ttmJtcIQ&oe=6A281432"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nVbrSzbWdC4Q7kNvwE7rruI&_nc_oc=AdrriCCNf4RdQqlZC1EEJWePbfbuZMKlG2MqEvgUllWYTIbDm2gMGSBKVIJCb3yxZM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8hyeRE9wkyeXdUCBxC7Ies5ZX2axrBpSAZirmiOWUO2A&oe=6A2821D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p